* ====================================================================
* IBM MQ 9.4 - Auckland Worker / Partial Repository Node 1 (QM_AKL_PR1)
* ====================================================================

* 1. Close Channel Authentication and Connection Authentication
ALTER QMGR CONNAUTH(' ') CHLAUTH(DISABLED)
ALTER AUTHINFO(DEV.AUTHINFO) AUTHTYPE(IDPWOS) CHCKCLNT(NONE)
REFRESH SECURITY TYPE(CONNAUTH)
REFRESH SECURITY TYPE(AUTHSERV)
ALTER QMGR CCSID(1208)

* 2. appoint DEADQ
DEFINE QLOCAL(DEADQ) REPLACE
ALTER QMGR DEADQ(DEADQ)

* 3. Define Cluster Receiver Channel
DEFINE CHANNEL(TO.QM_AKL_PR1) CHLTYPE(CLUSRCVR) TRPTYPE(TCP) +
  CONNAME('mq-akl-pr1(1414)') CLUSTER(AKL_CLUSTER) +
  DESCR('Cluster Receiver channel for QM_AKL_PR1') REPLACE

* 4. Define Cluster Sender Channel (Pointing to Full Repository)
DEFINE CHANNEL(TO.QM_AKL_FR) CHLTYPE(CLUSSDR) TRPTYPE(TCP) +
  CONNAME('mq-akl-fr(1414)') CLUSTER(AKL_CLUSTER) +
  DESCR('Cluster Sender channel pointing to FR') REPLACE

* 5. Define Backout Queue for Poison Messages (金融级异常处理)
DEFINE QLOCAL(PAYMENT.CLUSTER.IN.BOQ) DESCR('Backout Queue for Poison Messages') REPLACE

* 6. Define Local Queue and Share it in the Cluster
* This hosts the actual physical messages and will receive messages via round-robin.
DEFINE QLOCAL(PAYMENT.CLUSTER.IN) CLUSTER(AKL_CLUSTER) BOTHRESH(3) BOQNAME('PAYMENT.CLUSTER.IN.BOQ') DESCR('Clustered Local Queue for Processing Payments') REPLACE

* 1. 创建服务器连接通道 (SVRCONN)
DEFINE CHANNEL('DEV.ADMIN.SVRCONN') CHLTYPE(SVRCONN) TRPTYPE(TCP) MCAUSER('mqm') REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL(PAYMENT.TRANSFER.DEBIT.Q.TEST) CLUSTER(AKL_CLUSTER) DEFPSIST(YES) REPLACE
DEFINE QL(ERROR.Q) REPLACE

alter ql(PAYMENT.TRANSFER.DEBIT.Q) DEFBIND(NOTFIXED)

